    {
      "subId": "7301802",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arapandu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730180201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730180201": {
            "id": "730180201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Nara {NICKNAME}, and Paimon, thank you for helping Aranara. Arapandu senses that the branches blocking the stream in various places have been removed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180202"
            ]
          },
          "730180202": {
            "id": "730180202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh! So we can go and heal the Varuna Contraption now, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180203"
            ]
          },
          "730180203": {
            "id": "730180203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "Soon, but not yet. The root system is deep underground, and the entrance is in the center of the Varunastra.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180204"
            ]
          },
          "730180204": {
            "id": "730180204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Varunastra... You've mentioned that before, haven't you, Arapandu?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180205"
            ]
          },
          "730180205": {
            "id": "730180205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#It's a manifestation of the power of the Varuna Contraption. When it displays its power, it will be taller than the tallest tree in Vana. Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon saw it before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180206"
            ]
          },
          "730180206": {
            "id": "730180206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Do you mean that place from which water jets out occasionally? Are we seriously going through the center of that thing!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180208",
              "730180210"
            ]
          },
          "730180208": {
            "id": "730180208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180211"
            ]
          },
          "730180211": {
            "id": "730180211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What if it activates just as we go in...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180212"
            ]
          },
          "730180212": {
            "id": "730180212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The water jet is so high, and it looks really powerful too... Paimon can't figure out how we're going to get into its center..."
          },
          "730180210": {
            "id": "730180210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301806",
      "subQuestName": "Head near the Varunastra",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301807",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arapandu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730180401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730180401": {
            "id": "730180401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's even more impressive when you see it up close...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180402"
            ]
          },
          "730180402": {
            "id": "730180402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "The Varuna Contraption is a creation of the Lord of Dendro. It sends forth water that brings life, turning Valuka into Vana, replacing that which was once yellow with green, and turning barren land into a land full of life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180403"
            ]
          },
          "730180403": {
            "id": "730180403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It sounds miraculous. \"Water that brings life\"... Wow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180404"
            ]
          },
          "730180404": {
            "id": "730180404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Can this water be consumed? Will it have any special effects?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180406",
              "730180415"
            ]
          },
          "730180406": {
            "id": "730180406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Would that happen to you, or Paimon?"
          },
          "730180415": {
            "id": "730180415",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, it might be possible to live long enough to eat every dish in Teyvat that way!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180416"
            ]
          },
          "730180416": {
            "id": "730180416",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But where will those who share the taste be then...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180417"
            ]
          },
          "730180417": {
            "id": "730180417",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Guess living too long is not entirely a good thing, huh..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301808",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arapandu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730180801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730180801": {
            "id": "730180801",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The entrance to the underground... It's opened up!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180802"
            ]
          },
          "730180802": {
            "id": "730180802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I feel like something's missing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180803"
            ]
          },
          "730180803": {
            "id": "730180803",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, that's true! Look at this giant, empty hole... Well, at least it's not a hole in our hearts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180804"
            ]
          },
          "730180804": {
            "id": "730180804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Let's go down together, Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180805"
            ]
          },
          "730180805": {
            "id": "730180805",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "But we must be careful on the road ahead. It is dark and sunless underground. The place where seeds used to sleep peacefully has likely become the lair of the Fungi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180806"
            ]
          },
          "730180806": {
            "id": "730180806",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arapandu",
            "text": "#Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon are Aranara's friends. Aranara do not have great power, but if you are in danger, Aranara will try to protect you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180807"
            ]
          },
          "730180807": {
            "id": "730180807",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arabalika",
            "text": "Nothing to fear. Arabalika is around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180808"
            ]
          },
          "730180808": {
            "id": "730180808",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We've been through gales and high water! This won't scare us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180809"
            ]
          },
          "730180809": {
            "id": "730180809",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arakunti",
            "text": "There shouldn't be any great winds down there. Water, maybe, but no big waves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180810"
            ]
          },
          "730180810": {
            "id": "730180810",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hm... So you're still taking our words at face value, huh, Arakunti...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180811"
            ]
          },
          "730180811": {
            "id": "730180811",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"Gales and high water\" means that a person has been through a lot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180812"
            ]
          },
          "730180812": {
            "id": "730180812",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arakunti",
            "text": "Arakunti understands now. Paimon's words are difficult to understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180813"
            ]
          },
          "730180813": {
            "id": "730180813",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon would say the same to you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180814"
            ]
          },
          "730180814": {
            "id": "730180814",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Anyway, Fungi aren't scary at all! If this really is their lair... we'll have all-you-can-eat mushrooms for dinner tonight!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730180815"
            ]
          },
          "730180815": {
            "id": "730180815",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, let's hurry down once you're ready!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7301823",
